0000EDr 1               
0000EDr 1               ; The RamWorks: bank 0 is the regular auxiliary memory auxtest just used,
0000EDr 1               ; banks 1-3 are their own; a bank that does not exist is ignored; ALTZP's
0000EDr 1               ; zero page follows the bank.  Carry set on failure; every switch and the
0000EDr 1               ; bank register restored before any branch into RAM - and the stack is not
0000EDr 1               ; touched while ALTZP is on, since the return address is on the main one.
0000EDr 1               rwtest:
0000EDr 1  8D 05 C0             sta $C005               ; RAMWRT aux
